比如普通局部变量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-mg4m46t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-mg4m46t","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112245-3mwdg1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-3mwdg1l","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组内共享内存 —— 每个线程组独立拥有，比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupshared"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 变量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-2o11qgk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-2o11qgk","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112245-6x93qzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-6x93qzz","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全局内存 —— 所有线程组共享，比如可读写数据流、纹理等"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-ga5ln4v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-ga5ln4v","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112245-11w0fpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-11w0fpu","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存同步"}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-411idlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-411idlw","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让之前写入的内存在后续访问时保证最新可见，不被缓存或乱序，举例："}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-motvs7e","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-motvs7e","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"groupshared int data;\n\n[numthreads(2, 1, 1)]\nvoid CSMain(uint3 tid : SV_GroupThreadID)\n{\n    if (tid.x == 0)\n        data = 123;\n    // 线程 1 可能此时还没看到 data=123\n    // 因此我们可以在这等待内存同步完成（添加一些内存同步API）\n    int v = data;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-v5oxwi0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-v5oxwi0","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112245-9r6qz70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-9r6qz70","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程同步"}]},{"ID":"20251121112245-4p1q74i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112245-4p1q74i","updated":"20251121112245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让所有线程等一等，等大家都执行到同一位置后再继续执行"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112246-2ghdxui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112246-2ghdxui","updated":"20251121112254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同步函数："}]},{"ID":"20251121112304-cyeonhe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-cyeonhe","updated":"20251121113653"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112304-pmmkne0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-pmmkne0","updated":"20251121113653"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112300-cuzncs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112300-cuzncs9","updated":"20251121112308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GroupMemoryBarrierWithGroupSync()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251121112306-2wuavvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112306-2wuavvh","updated":"20251121112349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程同步 + 内存同步（组内共享内存，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupshared"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、当前组写的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RWBuffer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Texture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​等，不跨线程组）\n让同一个线程组内部的所有线程在某个时刻进行汇合同步\n最常用的同步函数，一般所有涉及 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupshared"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的协作计算都要用它\n假设一个线程组 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[numthreads(8,8,1)]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，每组有 64 个线程，这些线程是并行执行的\n但是在某些时刻，我们可能希望该组所有线程都完成了当前阶段后，再一起进行下一阶段\n这时候我们就可以调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GroupMemoryBarrierWithGroupSync()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数"}]},{"ID":"20251121113441-46c63vg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251121113441-46c63vg","updated":"20251121113653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"groupshared int data;\n\n[numthreads(2, 1, 1)]\nvoid CSMain(uint3 tid : SV_GroupThreadID)\n{\n    if (tid.x == 0)\n        data = 123;\n    // 让所有线程都执行到这一步时，再执行继续并行执行后边的逻辑，并且此时内存也同步了\n    GroupMemoryBarrierWithGroupSync();\n    int v = data;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112304-ms3tamy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-ms3tamy","updated":"20251121112304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112300-ns0soup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112300-ns0soup","updated":"20251121112312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GroupMemoryBarrier()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251121112310-5klj8cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112310-5klj8cw","updated":"20251121112321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存同步（组内共享内存，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupshared"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、当前组写的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RWBuffer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Texture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​等，不跨线程组）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112304-0xyizzx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-0xyizzx","updated":"20251121112304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112300-van7mv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112300-van7mv1","updated":"20251121112356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"DeviceMemoryBarrier()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251121112358-nun1tac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112358-nun1tac","updated":"20251121112401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存同步（全局内存同步，比如可读写的纹理和数据流，跨线程组），跨组的全局内存同步"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112304-9p11a3w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-9p11a3w","updated":"20251121112304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112300-dykzkgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112300-dykzkgr","updated":"20251121112404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AllMemoryBarrier()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251121112406-i7mif9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112406-i7mif9f","updated":"20251121112408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存同步（组内共享内存 + 全局内存 都得同步，跨线程组），同步所有层级内存"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112304-a1o7avh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112304-a1o7avh","updated":"20251121112304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112300-7cjnwom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112300-7cjnwom","updated":"20251121112412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AllMemoryBarrierWithGroupSync()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251121112414-5md7vyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112414-5md7vyq","updated":"20251121112416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最强版，线程同步 + 所有内存同步，等待组内所有线程汇合，确保所有类型内存（共享内存 + 全局内存）写入完成"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112438-cbuwyg5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112438-cbuwyg5","updated":"20251121114334"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112438-1kutrt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112438-1kutrt4","updated":"20251121112440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原子操作"}]},{"ID":"20251121112443-a7mswe0","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251121112443-a7mswe0","updated":"20251121112444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251121112444-fuln78h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112444-fuln78h","updated":"20251121112542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原子操作用于并行计算时防止多个线程同时修改同一份数据造成的竞态条件\n指一个操作在 GPU 上执行时，不会被其他线程中断或同时修改同一内存地址"}]},{"ID":"20251121112516-5f2ew93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121112516-5f2ew93","updated":"20251121112516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251121112454-6y47u23","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251121112454-6y47u23","updated":"20251121112512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"RWStructuredBuffer\u003cint\u003e Counter;\n\n[numthreads(64, 1, 1)]\nvoid CSMain(uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID)\n{\n    Counter[0] += 1;   // 64个线程同时执行时，结果可能 Counter[0] \u003c 64 ！\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121112521-88w8jc7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251121112521-88w8jc7","updated":"20251121114223"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121112605-524lln2","Type":"NodeLis